, "shape": 7, "name": "i2f_mode", "label": "i2f_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "i2f_mode"}], "flags": {}, "type": "NunchakuFluxDiTLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [403.5184631347656, 202], "pos": [-50.44831466674805, 131.5805206298828], "id": 448, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-nunchaku", "ver": "0.3.3", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"device_id": true, "cpu_offload": true, "data_type": true, "cache_threshold": true, "attention": true, "i2f_mode": true, "model_path": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"device_id": true, "cpu_offload": true, "data_type": true, "cache_threshold": true, "attention": true, "i2f_mode": true, "model_path": true}, "aux_id": "nunchaku-tech/ComfyUI-nunchaku", "Node name for S&R": "NunchakuFluxDiTLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n## Flux Kontext 提示词技巧\n\n使用英文\n\n### 1. 基础修改\n- 简单直接：\n- Change the car color to red\n- 将汽车颜色改为红色\n- 保持风格：\n- Change to daytime while maintaining the same style of the painting\n- 保持画风不变，换到白天\n\n### 2. 风格转换\n**原则：**\n- 明确命名风格：\n- Transform to Bauhaus art style\n- 转变为包豪斯艺术风格\n- 描述特征：\n- Transform to oil painting with visible brushstrokes, thick paint texture\n- 转变为油画，笔触清晰，颜料质感厚重\n- 保留构图：\n- Change to Bauhaus style while maintaining the original composition\n- 保持原有构图，改为包豪斯风格\n\n### 3. 角色一致性\n**框架：**\n- 具体描述：\n- The woman with short black hair 而非\"她\"\n- 黑色短发女人  而非\"她\"\n- 保留特征：\n- while maintaining the same facial features, hairstyle, and expression\n- 保持相同的面部特征、发型和表情\n\n- 分步修改：先改背景，再改动作\n\n### 4. 文本编辑\n- 使用引号：`\"Replace 'joy' with 'BFL'\"`\n- 保持格式：`\"Replace text while maintaining the same font style\"`\n\n## 常见问题解决\n\n### 角色变化过大\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Transform the person into a Viking\n- 把人变成维京人\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Change the clothes to be a viking warrior while preserving facial features\n- 更换衣服，成为一名维京战士，同时保留面部特征\n### 构图位置改变\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Put him on a beach\n- 把他放在沙滩上\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Change the background to a beach while keeping the person in the exact same position, scale, and pose\n- 将背景更改为海滩，同时保持人物处于完全相同的位置、比例和姿势\n### 风格应用不准确\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Make it a sketch\n- 将其绘制成草图\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Convert to pencil sketch with natural graphite lines, cross-hatching, and visible paper texture\n- 转换为具有自然石墨线、交叉影线和可见纸张纹理的铅笔素描\n\n\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n- Change [object] to [new state], keep [content to preserve] unchanged\n- 将[对象]更改为[新状态]，保持[要保留的内容]不变\n\n**风格转换：**\n- Transform to [specific style], while maintaining [composition/character/other] unchanged\n- 转换为[特定风格]，同时保持[构图/角色/其他]不变\n\n**背景替换：**\n- Change the background to [new background], keep the subject in the exact same position and pose\n- 将背景更改为[新背景]，保持主体处于完全相同的位置和姿势\n\n**文本编辑：**\n- Replace '[original text]' with '[new text]', maintain the same font style\n- 将“[原始文本]”替换为“[新文本]”，保持相同的字体样式\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Flux Kontext 提示词技巧", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [528.9592895507812, 1429.5701904296875], "pos": [-1215.96826171875, -208.13616943359375], "id": 187, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [677], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 669, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [169.08554077148438, 26], "pos": [419.9666748046875, 711.7164306640625], "id": 447, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.39", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R